Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Keyboard light switch and brightness in Settings >
 Keyboard

Adds a Keyboard light section under Settings > System > Keyboard with a
Keyboard backlight switch and a ten-step Brightness slider. They write
persist.sys.sable.kbd_backlight (0/1) and
persist.sys.sable.kbd_backlight_level (1-255); the Sable product layer's
init rule copies those to the keyboard driver, which applies them now and
on every screen wake.

The section is shown only when ro.sable.keyboard_backlight is true, which
the Q25 layer sets. Pure mapping and parsing in
sable/SableKeyboardBacklight.java.
